#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/quadratic.rst:124
msgid "Heat-Glow and Freeze-Reflect Hybrid"
msgstr "加热-发光与冷却-反射结合"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/quadratic.rst:128
msgid ""
"This blending mode is called \"Heat-Glow and Freeze-Reflect Hybrid\" in "
"English."
msgstr "此混合模式的英文名为“Heat-Glow and Freeze-Reflect Hybrid”。"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/quadratic.rst:130
msgid ""
"Mix of the continuous quadratic blending modes. Very similar to Overlay, and "
"sometimes provides better result than Overlay."
msgstr ""
"把所有基本二次方混合模式连续结合运用。效果接近叠加模式，有时效果还会比叠加模"
"式更好。"

